WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:16.129
floated out to the soccer field where Winnie was flying her broom.

2
00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.311
She looked so happy soaring over the field.

3
00:00:19.331 --> 00:00:21.854
"I'm coming in for a landing!"

4
00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:23.135
he heard her say.

5
00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:25.237
"Me too!"

6
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:28.640
cried another witch, tilting her broom down toward the field.

7
00:00:29.548 --> 00:00:32.050
Ben watched Winnie cruise to a soft landing.

8
00:00:33.031 --> 00:00:35.953
Then he floated over to her, his heart beating fast.

9
00:00:37.114 --> 00:00:40.877
He had come outside to ask her to the Monster Mash dance on Friday night.

10
00:00:40.897 --> 00:00:42.899
"What if she says no?"

11
00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:44.780
Ben thought, suddenly panicked.

12
00:00:46.121 --> 00:00:47.202
That would be terrible.

13
00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:51.686
He'd feel so stupid, and then things would get awkward between them.

14
00:00:52.827 --> 00:00:58.892
Maybe he shouldn't— Just then Winnie smiled at him.

15
00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.662
Her green eyes sparkled in the sunlight.

16
00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:04.565
Ben smiled back nervously.

17
00:01:05.826 --> 00:01:07.788
Winnie could sometimes read people's thoughts.

18
00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:10.550
Did she know what he was thinking now?

19
00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.654
"Great flying, Winnie," said Ben quickly.

20
00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.417
"Thanks," she answered.

21
00:01:17.437 --> 00:01:20.460
"I'm practicing for my broom-flying test.

22
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:24.724
If I pass, I'll finally have my broom-flying license.

23
00:01:26.492 --> 00:01:29.693
Then maybe I can join the Witches' Formation team.

24
00:01:30.293 --> 00:01:33.094
They get to fly over the school during important events."

25
00:01:33.114 --> 00:01:36.855
"I'm sure you'll pass," said Ben.

26
00:01:37.895 --> 00:01:41.376
He knew he had to ask her now, before he lost all his courage.

27
00:01:42.797 --> 00:01:48.298
He took a deep breath—such a deep breath, he suddenly felt dizzy.

28
00:01:50.099 --> 00:01:51.119
Winnie stared at him.

29
00:01:51.139 --> 00:01:53.480
"Ben, are you okay?

30
00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:56.601
You look pale, even for a ghost."

31
00:01:56.621 --> 00:02:01.164
"I'm fine," Ben lied.

32
00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:03.586
His heart pounded faster.

33
00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:10.530
"Winnie, will you um Smiling, Winnie tilted her head.

34
00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:18.796
"Will I you go to the Monster Mash with me?"

35
00:02:25.508 --> 00:02:27.650
For a moment Winnie didn't say anything.

36
00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.631
"Oh no!"

37
00:02:30.172 --> 00:02:31.613
Ben thought, panicking again.

38
00:02:31.633 --> 00:02:36.697
"I never should have—" "I'd love to," she said.

39
00:02:36.717 --> 00:02:39.499
"You would?

40
00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.141
I mean, wow!

41
00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.141
That's great!"

42
00:02:42.902 --> 00:02:44.643
Suddenly Ben didn't know what to say.

43
00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:47.886
"Dancing is fun, right?"

44
00:02:47.906 --> 00:02:51.209
"I love dancing," Winnie agreed.

45
00:02:51.229 --> 00:02:54.912
"I love it almost as much as I love broom flying."

46
00:02:56.028 --> 00:02:57.529
"Me too," said Ben.

47
00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:01.132
"I mean, not broom flying but just regular flying.

48
00:03:02.152 --> 00:03:04.174
Not that there's anything wrong with broom flying.

49
00:03:04.314 --> 00:03:12.740
It's just that I'm a ghost and a dumb thing to say," Ben thought as Winnie giggled.

50
00:03:14.601 --> 00:03:16.202
He was babbling like an idiot.

51
00:03:16.222 --> 00:03:20.465
"I'll pick you up at seven," Ben told her.

52
00:03:20.485 --> 00:03:26.493
"Okay?" "Actually," Winnie said, "I'm on the decorating committee.

53
00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:29.535
So I have to get to the gym early to help decorate.

54
00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.757
Maybe we can just meet at the dance?"

55
00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:34.198
"Sure," said Ben.

56
00:03:34.218 --> 00:03:36.020
"That sounds great.

57
00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:37.801
I'll see you at school tomorrow."

58
00:03:37.821 --> 00:03:40.663
"Okay," said Winnie, grinning at him.

59
00:03:43.705 --> 00:03:45.746
Ben floated away as fast as he could.

60
00:03:46.847 --> 00:03:48.328
He could not believe his good luck.

61
00:03:49.189 --> 00:03:53.452
Ever since he'd first seen Winnie, he'd thought she was the most beautiful witch in the world.

62
00:03:54.396 --> 00:03:56.317
And now she was going to the dance with him!

63
00:04:02.261 --> 00:04:04.623
The next morning during homeroom, Mr.

64
00:04:04.663 --> 00:04:06.804
Freaky's voice crackled over the loudspeaker.

65
00:04:06.824 --> 00:04:09.046
"Good morning, students.

66
00:04:10.207 --> 00:04:14.149
I wanted to let everyone know that Miss Bungle is out sick with the flu today.

67
00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:19.032
So all of her broom-flying classes and activities are canceled until she returns.

68
00:04:20.013 --> 00:04:20.513
Thank you."

69
00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.176
Ben shot Winnie a sympathetic look.

70
00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:27.166
She looked pretty disappointed at the news.

71
00:04:27.186 --> 00:04:32.589
"Maybe Miss Bungle will be back soon," he whispered.

72
00:04:32.609 --> 00:04:35.091
"Yeah, I hope she's okay."

73
00:04:35.531 --> 00:04:37.433
Winnie smiled and tried to shrug it off.

74
00:04:39.074 --> 00:04:40.895
But Ben could tell that she was upset.

75
00:04:40.915 --> 00:04:44.958
"At least I have the dance to look forward to tonight, right?"

76
00:04:44.978 --> 00:04:47.980
"Right," he answered with a grin.

77
00:04:49.441 --> 00:04:51.763
After homeroom they walked together to Cooking.

78
00:04:52.783 --> 00:04:55.818
Today Ben was actually looking forward to cooking something.

79
00:04:56.719 --> 00:04:59.581
Mr. Freaky had hired a new teacher to replace Mrs.

80
00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:03.304
Hag. This one was supposed to be a much better cook than Mrs.

81
00:05:03.344 --> 00:05:09.589
Hag. "Good morning, monsters," said the new teacher, who was wearing goggles and an apron.

82
00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:11.771
"My name is Mr.

83
00:05:11.891 --> 00:05:15.173
Icky." His four tentacles waved to the students.

84
00:05:16.074 --> 00:05:19.517
"Today we're going to make slug cupcakes with rotten-egg frosting.

85
00:05:20.297 --> 00:05:21.438
They're for the dance tonight."

86
00:05:23.532 --> 00:05:24.453
"Woo-hoo!" called Mog.

87
00:05:25.573 --> 00:05:29.296
He was sitting with his new girlfriend, Lilly, and a few other monsters.

88
00:05:29.316 --> 00:05:32.298
"Slug cupcakes are awesome!"

89
00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.481
Soon the students started cooking.

90
00:05:37.822 --> 00:05:43.466
As Ben plopped slugs into his cupcake batter, he overheard Winnie talking to some other girl monsters about

91
00:05:43.506 --> 00:05:43.966
the dance.

92
00:05:45.347 --> 00:05:48.509
"I got my dress at Frightful Fashion," said a witch.

93
00:05:48.529 --> 00:05:51.792
"My mom bought me some new shoes too."

94
00:05:54.364 --> 00:05:58.665
"My dress is from the Suction Shop," said an octopus monster.

95
00:05:58.685 --> 00:06:03.867
"It's bright pink, and guess what—" She waved a bunch of her arms.

96
00:06:03.887 --> 00:06:06.067
"It's sleeveless!"

97
00:06:10.108 --> 00:06:12.389
You're going to look great," said Winnie.

98
00:06:13.669 --> 00:06:16.010
She glanced over at Ben with a shy smile.

99
00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:20.411
"My dress is from the Witch's Closet.

100
00:06:21.451 --> 00:06:25.298
It's really pretty—black, of course, with lots of lace."

101
00:06:29.102 --> 00:06:34.028
Ben smiled back at Winnie, and he was still smiling a minute later as he started stirring the

102
00:06:34.068 --> 00:06:34.829
cupcake batter.

103
00:06:36.251 --> 00:06:38.073
He couldn't wait to see Winnie tonight.

104
00:06:39.175 --> 00:06:42.699
Their first Monster Mash dance together was going to be perfect.
